    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to:"
