  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Integrating both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Substituting value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>SO,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
